{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093590/extras/welcometothecafe.png?t=1739543731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kemopop! is an active puzzle eroge featuring several cute, effeminate kemono (&quot;furry&quot;) boys, all working in food service. Match sweets and make them undress...!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like feminine boys, especially ones who are well-endowed (and sometimes, <i>very</i> well endowed), this is what you've been waiting for. Kemopop! features characters from various artists, in over 30+ stages!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093590/extras/kappuazura.png?t=1739543731\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Hand-Drawn Original Content:</strong> All artwork was made special for Kemopop!. Play stages made in collaboration with excellent kemono artists!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Browse the artwork you've unlocked, and use it to generate wallpaper...!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Universal Controls:</strong> Play with just a mouse, keyboard, touchscreen, or controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Your Character Here:</strong> Do you have artwork of a character and a bit of free time? Put it in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Gumball Machine:</strong> Unlock additional content: new sweets, another half of the soundtrack, fanart, and developer commentary!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Skip It All:</strong> Don't wanna play? Use the Bonus settings to get right to the <i>content</i>!!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Serving Streak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093590/b5545449ecd616ae110b74f33e473e2a65f1fc25.jpg"},{"name":"All